# Input
```jsx
/* should not generate diagnostics */

// Valid: modern shrink utilities
<div class="shrink" />;
<div class="shrink-0" />;

// Valid: modern grow utilities
<div class="grow" />;
<div class="grow-0" />;

// Valid: modern text utilities
<div class="text-ellipsis" />;
<div class="text-clip" />;

// Valid: modern box decoration utilities
<div class="box-decoration-slice" />;
<div class="box-decoration-clone" />;

// Valid: with variants
<div class="hover:shrink" />;
<div class="focus:hover:grow-0" />;

// Valid: other classes
<div class="flex p-4 m-2" />;

```
